# Commit messages

Write every commit as the person making the change.

- Do not add a co-author trailer, footer, or `Made-with` line.
- Do not mention Cursor in the subject or body.
- Do not pass `--trailer` or a `Co-authored-by` line for Cursor.
- This rule may name the policy. The commit message itself must not.
